Scope note (non-binding, for clarity only)

This licence covers the material authored by this repository's authors:
the single published Chinese director console workflow
(workflows/current/V29_chinese_director_production_8197.json), the self-developed
ComfyUI custom nodes under custom_nodes/local_author/, the frontend control layer,
the setup/verify/sanitize scripts, the fixtures and the documentation.

It does NOT cover, and this repository does not redistribute:
  * any model weights (no .safetensors / .ckpt / .pt / .pth / .gguf / shards /
    caches are contained here — see docs/MODELS.md for upstream sources);
  * the ComfyUI engine itself (upstream: Comfy-Org/ComfyUI, GPL-3.0);
  * third-party custom nodes, which are referenced with pinned versions and
    installed from their own upstream repositories
    (see docs/UPSTREAM_ATTRIBUTION.md and THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md);
  * historic workflows, historical engineering reports and the production-side
    changelog/audit archive, which are archived locally by the author and are
    deliberately not published (they are not part of the Software above).

Where such local archives are cited by the published benchmarks, the citation
uses a LOCAL_ARCHIVE: prefix and names the source document; the referenced bytes
are not distributed with this repository.
